And what was it like inside were ?
Oh yes, sacks of  other and they used to have a proper corner seedman's shop, which you don't see about today the er Garden Centre has knocked all that on the nut hasn't it really?
What about  chemist.
Whereabouts was that?
That was er  coming down from  Street you come to  then you come to  the grocers and  was next- door there  
that's the only link with Caldmore as it used to be and Caldmore as it is now 
