No no no no there was nobody, now er probably up at the top of Gallway there though one or two would have er stables I should think, one or two of those houses, but by and large no I shouldn't think so.
Now there is another, another part it's very nice and that is round  Lane and er  Road and all round there used to be very nice at one time.
